+## 9. Phase 13: PTB-XL Full Scale Training (v3.0)
+**Goal**: Scale training to the 21.8k PTB-XL dataset and deploy Engine A and B.
+**Version**: v3.0
+**Date**: 2026-03-15 (UTC)
+**Author**: Antigravity & Ayush
+
+### Outcome & Artifacts
+- **Engine A (Visual Router)**: Re-trained ResNet-50 on generated 2D grid images (Rhythm vs Structure).
+  - **Validation Accuracy**: 75.02%
+  - **Metrics**: Excellent Structure recall (92% precision).
+  - **Artifact**: models/visual_router.pth
+
+- **Engine B (Signal Specialist)**: Scaled the SE-ResNet-34 (1D) model from 12 classes to the full 26-class PTB-XL taxonomy.
+  - **Validation Accuracy**: 67.28% (highly aggressive 26-class mapping).
+  - **Optimization**: Mixup+Smoothing pushed convergence to 90% Training Accuracy before plateauing.
+  - **Artifact**: models/checkpoint_latest.pth
+
